<Slide style={{ background: '#F0E4D2' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 40, background: '#7E9476', borderRadius: 4 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>第 8 步：安全強化與資料備份</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 6, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px', borderLeft: '6px solid #C0392B' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>防火牆最小化</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3E2A1E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>安全組只開 80 / 443 / 22。22 號（SSH）可以改為只限自己 IP，或用 Instance Connect 之後索性關咗 22 號埠。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px', borderLeft: '6px solid #7E9476' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>系統自動更新</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3E2A1E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>sudo apt install -y unattended-upgrades，令 Ubuntu 自動執行安全補丁，唔使記得手動 update。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px', borderLeft: '6px solid #C0392B' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>禁密碼 SSH 登入</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3E2A1E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>改 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 設 PasswordAuthentication no，之後淨係可以用 key 登入，防暴力破解。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px', borderLeft: '6px solid #7E9476' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>每日 S3 備份</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3E2A1E', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>aws s3 cp ~/app/database.db s3://aurora-backups/db-$(date +%F).db，再加落 crontab 每日 3:30 自動執行。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7c6f63' }}>寶天醫館 · AWS 上線手把手教學</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7c6f63' }}>15 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
